el 449 becomes 400), and your stat points and skill trees are given back. See Economy formulas .", "html": "<p>Changing class: the first change of a profile is free, then it costs <strong>100 shards × your level</strong> (at least 1,000). There is a 60 s delay between two changes, your level is kept by steps of 50 (level 449 becomes 400), and your stat points and skill trees are given back. See <a href=\"/en/w/overrank/formulas/economy\">Economy formulas</a>.</p>"}]}], "media": [{"src": "/api/media/wiki/2026/10/model-classes-human.glb", "alt": "Human: interactive 3D view", "kind": "3d-model"}], "related": [{"text": "Reaper", "href": "/en/w/overrank/classes/reaper", "img": "/games/overrank/classes/reaper.webp"}, {"text": "Overlord", "href": "/en/w/overrank/classes/overlord", "img": "/games/overrank/classes/overlord.webp"}, {"text": "Warper", "href": "/en/w/overrank/classes/warper", "img": "/games/overrank/classes/warper.webp"}, {"text": "Assassin", "href": "/en/w/overrank/classes/assassin", "img": "/games/overrank/classes/assassin.webp"}], "toc": [{"id": "overview", "text": "Overview"}, {"id": "playstyle", "text": "Playstyle"}, {"id": "bonuses", "text": "Bonuses"}, {"id": "equipment", "text": "Equipment"}, {"id": "skills", "text": "Skills"}, {"id": "how-to-unlock", "text": "How to unlock"}], "last_edited": "Nov 2, 2026", "last_edited_by": "Awaitlab", "incomplete_at_source": false, "source": {"url": "https://overrank.awaitlab.com/en/w/overrank/classes/human", "path": "/en/w/overrank/classes/human"}, "raw_links": ["/en", "/en/forum/new", "/en/w/overrank", "/en/w/overrank/classes", "/en/w/overrank/classes/assassin", "/en/w/overrank/classes/human/edit", "/en/w/overrank/classes/overlord", "/en/w/overrank/classes/reaper", "/en/w/overrank/classes/warper", "/en/w/overrank/formulas/economy", "/en/w/overrank/skills/battle-focus", "/en/w/overrank/skills/human-spirit", "/en/w/overrank/skills/iron-skin", "/en/w/overrank/skills/rift-dash", "/en/w/overrank/skills/rift-lance", "/en/